# Lane notes: M14 (ide)

## Shared-file requests for the integrator

- Cargo.lock: new crate `mpp-ide` adds eframe 0.37 (glow), egui 0.37, lyon_tessellation 1,
  rfd 0.18; dev-dependency egui_kittest 0.37 (wgpu, snapshot). Regenerate the lockfile after merging.
- The Placeholder match arm in mpp-eval/src/lower.rs was applied by the integrator (b360c55).

## Module map (for the later IDE lanes)

- `explorer/`: flat `.mpp` list (`list_mpp`, `show`). C10 replaces it with the tree.
- `tabs/`: the tab strip (`Tab`, `TabAction`). C10 adds the dirty dot, errors, close all.
- `editor/`: `Editor` (`insert_text`, `delete`, `delete_range`, `move_caret`, `replace_node`,
  undo/redo) and `editor/symbols.rs` (live replacement, completions). C9 builds the template
  and box editor on `replace_node` and `Page::slots`-style stops.
- `diagnostics/`: `Problem` list per page and the wavy underline painter. N9 extends it.
- `theme/`: `Mode`, `install_fonts` (Latin Modern Roman for all chrome), `apply`. N14 finishes it.
- `layout/`: sizes and constants only. N13 replaces it with the tile manager.
- `page/`: document to typeset page (`build_page`), caret stops, hit boxes.
- `figure.rs`: `FigureDrawer` trait; `PlaceholderFigure` draws a "Figure" box until the plot
  crate implements it (`IdeApp::set_figure_drawer`).

## Behaviour notes

- The page is rebuilt from the current text every edit; evaluation results are matched by block id,
  so a stale result never shows at the wrong place. Parser problems show at once, evaluation
  problems only when the evaluation is of the same text.
- Raw text is only reachable through View -> Show file text (off at start, not persisted).
- Ghost (grey) results show only for `Relation` lines; definitions do not get ghosts yet.
- Calculus holders (integrals, derivatives) show unevaluated until the calculus phase lands.
- Screenshots: `cargo test -p mpp-ide --test ui` writes PNGs to `target/ide-snapshots/`.
